      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FREDDY DEEDS (1) well back settling but did wind up strongly to finish 4th and beaten only 3 lengths (22.78) at this track. Form here at the trip sound including two wins. Can atone. SHEIKH OF TWEAK (4) missed the frame last time when fourth (22.47) at Ballarat in a Grade 5 but not beaten far the start prior. Well placed here and can atone this time. CHEEKY ALESSIA (8) was responsible for a modest effort most recently when eighth at Ballarat over 390m behind Paw Christie (22.72) in a Grade 5. Was in the money the start prior. Strong form has emerged from her last run. A forward showing wouldn't surprise. SAINT MICK (2) missed the placings here last start but is well-placed to make amends.",
